Code shared with PJA and PRA
----------------------------

pas/pmpaarith.pas (binary arithmetic coder), pas/pmpamodel.pas (counters,
mixer and APM, with its SSE4.1 assembly), pas/pmpablake3.pas (BLAKE3),
pas/pmpaformat.pas (the container), pas/pmpafs.pas (verified writing),
pas/pmpapack.pas, pas/pmpacpu.pas, pas/pmpacli.pas (the command, adapted),
their tests (test_format, test_pmpafs, cli.sh, adapted), pas/pmpa.inc and
pas/collisions.py come from PJA
(https://github.com/YadeWira/PJA), by way of PRA
(https://github.com/YadeWira/PRA): same author, MIT License.

pas/tests/kat.txt holds test vectors of the official BLAKE3 implementation
(https://github.com/BLAKE3-team/BLAKE3), CC0 / Apache-2.0.
